abstract: End-to-end smoke test of the ORPM publishing pipeline against the Zenodo sandbox plus the GitHub stellab_research mirror. This deposition exercises validation, deposition creation, file upload, community attachment, DOI minting, CITATION.cff regeneration, and the GitHub mirror push under the institutional Stellab community.
